
 You are not a validated user or you have mis-typed your password;
    ---------------------------------
 If you are new to this BBS, you must
apply for validation by following these steps:
 1) Enter L at the prompt where it says <L>ogin....ect.
 2) Enter the information requested by the New User Door.
 3) Answer all the questions asked, failure to do so may get you a
    restricted access.  Notice that it asks about the width of you
    screen(usually 80 characters), Citadel needs to know how long
    a line on your screen can be to format correctly.
 4) Enter a User Name and Password.  Make the password unique and
    remember it for next time.  It is always safe to use a couple of
    words like "secret word", Do not use this example, I will delete
    any account created with a password of "secret word".  The sysop
    can read passwords.
 6) Type .Goto MAIL <RETURN>
 7) Then type 'E' in the Mail room to enter a message.
    Tell us a little bit about your self.
 3) End the message by typing <CR> twice and 'S'ave the message.
    ---------------------------------
    Users are automatically validated if they follow these simple rules.